==========================================================================
5. CARRIER TERMS AND THIRD-PARTY CODE
==========================================================================

PeterShip calls the USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL Express and Easyship APIs.
Each carrier's API is used under that carrier's own developer agreement,
which binds the account holder. The Owners' carrier accounts, keys and
negotiated rates are not part of PeterShip and are never licensed. No
carrier endorses PeterShip.

Open-source packages that PeterShip depends on remain under their own
licenses, listed in site/package.json and the lockfile. This license does
not change them.

